<title>COLOMBIA: TABLE - Papeles Nacionales 1H net falls 36.1 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Papeles Nacionales 1H net falls 36.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colombia's leading producer of</p>
<p>consumer tissue products, Papeles Nacionales</p>
<p>reported the following first-half results:</p>
<p>		  First-half 1997	     First-half 1996</p>
<p>Net income    3.39 billion pesos	  5.3 billion</p>
<p>Net revenues  29.7 billion		  29.7 billion</p>
<p>Total assets  125 billion		   138 billion</p>
<p>Earnings per share 4.3 pesos		N/A</p>
<p>Note: All figures are in Colombian pesos and results are subject to verification by Securities Superintendency.</p>
<p>((--Karl Penhaul, Bogota newsroom, 571 610 7944))</p>
</text>
